#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:29
#: 26ca3c0efa1d47c7be219635eed5416a
msgid ""
"**Tolerance**: Numerical tolerance is algorithm- and test-specific. The relevant test"
" or audit entry states the comparison and acceptance condition where one is "
"available."
