#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:138
#: cf7e57fd343e470daeb559c1d9c1d99e
msgid ""
"Corrects for the reduction in effective sample size caused by overlapping segments in"
" spectral estimation methods like Welch's."
msgstr "Welch 法等におけるセグメント間のオーバーラップによる有効サンプル数の減少を補正します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:140
#: 1ba6e4a5fe314752ae400506cbc0f3ba
msgid ""
"Here, VIF is not meant as the regression-style Variance Inflation Factor used in "
"multicollinearity diagnostics. In the codebase it is exposed as "
"`calculate_correlation_factor()` because the API is describing the concrete "
"operation: computing the overlap-induced correlation correction factor."
msgstr ""
"ここでの VIF は回帰分析の Variance Inflation Factor をそのまま指すのではなく、**オーバーラップ窓による分散膨張補正をコード上で "
"`calculate_correlation_factor()` として実装したもの**です。理論名と関数名が異なるのは、API "
"では「相関補正係数を計算する」役割を明示するためです。"

