msgid "The time system must be **GPS Time (no leap seconds)**."
msgstr "時刻系は **GPS 時刻（閏秒なし）** であること。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:176
