#: 125e4b77335f4327b731d8a15b13f7ed
msgid "5. MCMC / GLS Likelihood"
msgstr "5. MCMC / GLS 尤度"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:192
#: b26ace91a1df4c349e2bff54c696d217
msgid "**Target**: `run_mcmc`, `GLS`"
msgstr "**対象**: `run_mcmc`, `GLS`"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:194
#: 4f6945840e2246948b9563041194f5fc
msgid ""
"For complex-valued residuals, the MCMC likelihood path assumes a Hermitian quadratic "
"form `r.conj() @ cov_inv @ r` and then takes the real part. In practice, this means "
"the API can accept complex residual vectors without silently dropping the imaginary "
"component."
msgstr ""
"MCMC の対数尤度計算では、複素残差に対してもエルミート形式 `r.conj() @ cov_inv @ r` "
"の実部を用いる実装を前提にしています。つまり、**複素データを API にそのまま渡した場合でも、内部では複素共役を考慮した二次形式で評価**されます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:197
#: 0c1490ac8848491280dba0656037cfe5
msgid "`cov_inv` should be close to Hermitian positive-definite."
msgstr "共分散行列 `cov_inv` がエルミート正定値に近いこと。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:198
#: 228af9bd22bd44ed81d125437d32a6df
msgid ""
"The implementation is intended for a circular-complex-Gaussian-style treatment of "
"residuals rather than a naive \"real-part only\" model."
msgstr "複素残差は circular complex Gaussian に準じた扱いを想定しており、単純に実部だけへ切り捨てる挙動ではありません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:207
