#: 52be14286a014d42bba092145f62fbc4
msgid "6. Adaptive Whitening"
msgstr "6. 適応ホワイトニング"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:218
#: b378d207576c4f59a9a3eb1746a5ca26
msgid ""
"**Target**: `TimeSeriesMatrix.whiten_channels(eps=\"auto\")`, `whiten_matrix()`, "
"`gwexpy.signal.preprocessing.whiten()`, `WhiteningModel`"
msgstr ""
"**対象**: "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.whiten_channels(eps=\"auto\")`、`whiten_matrix()`、`gwexpy.signal.preprocessing.whiten()`、`WhiteningModel`"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:220
#: 67c4e12eebd740bdabd6a979e3e8d0ba
msgid ""
"Adaptive whitening uses an automatically chosen stabilization parameter so that PSD-"
"based normalization remains well behaved in the presence of very small bins or local "
"numerical underflow."
msgstr "適応ホワイトニングでは、自動的に決まる安定化パラメータを用いて、非常に小さい PSD ビンや局所的な数値アンダーフローがあっても正規化が破綻しにくいようにしています。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:223
#: f463c2a1e2f649cba2ccad97ee16a8c8
msgid ""
"The data are treated as locally quasi-stationary over the FFT segments used for "
"whitening."
msgstr "ホワイトニングに用いる FFT セグメントの範囲では、データが局所的に準定常とみなせること。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:224
#: d8f8f093c456423dae8e1dd6fb3a5020
msgid ""
"The adaptive `eps` path is intended to stabilize small denominators, not to "
"compensate for a badly chosen whitening window or clearly non-stationary bursts."
msgstr "適応 `eps` は小さい分母を安定化するためのものであり、明らかに非定常なバーストや不適切な窓長設定まで補償するものではありません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:226
